# Astro: the boot-success milestone (docs/02 §5.1, docs/05 §4, AD-011).
# Internal service whose dependencies DEFINE "this boot is good":
#   base set (M1) = astrod healthy + data-mount done.
# Rollback-participating app services (docs/08 §5) add themselves here as
# depends-on at image assembly (M4). rauc-mark-good gains
# "depends-on: boot-success" at M2 — if this milestone is never reached,
# the bootloader's attempt counters fall back to the other slot.

type = internal
depends-on: astrod
depends-on: data-mount
